      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.72 (down from ₹2.72 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹129.9m (down 1.6% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.60m (down 73% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.0% (down from 7.4% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was primarily driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 25% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 6% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
